PROVENANCE
----------
These rules are a curated, vendor-neutral subset of the rules used by Micelium
Lumen. Micelium-specific product-mapping metadata (the `micelium_product` field)
has been removed from the public subset; the AI-governance (AIGOV) rule domain is
not included in this public release.

Framework citations within the rules (CIS, NIST, HIPAA, PCI DSS, OWASP, ISO/IEC
27001, GDPR, EU AI Act, FedRAMP, SOC 2, etc.) are the property of their respective
standards bodies and are referenced for interoperability and explainability.
